<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12745" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκάμνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>grow quite weary, fail, flag utterly,</i> mostly abs.,
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1776
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				445b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.46
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Rufin.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ μήκει τοῦ χρόνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					2.91d
				</span></i>
			: c. part., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ζητῶν,
				μηχανώμενος,</span>
			<i>to be quite weary of</i> seeking, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Men.</u>
				81d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.6.35
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c.
			inf., <i>cease</i> to do, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοχθεῖν οὐκ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					135
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ ἀποκάμης σαυτὸν σῶσαι</span>
			<i>do</i> not <i>hesitate . .,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cri.</u>
				45b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c. acc.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πόνον</span>
			<i>flinch from</i> toil, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				7.5.19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πρὸς τὰς διαμαρτίας</span>”
				<i>to be disheartened by . .,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Arat.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
